@token = ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@sessionId = 1

### 산책 시작
POST http://localhost:8080/api/walks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 산책 일시정지
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/walks/{{sessionId}}/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 산책 재개
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/walks/{{sessionId}}/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 산책 완료 (포인트 배열 전송)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/walks/{{sessionId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endedAt": "2026-03-25T16:00:00",
  "points": [
    { "recordedAt": "2026-03-25T15:30:00", "lat": 37.5665, "lng": 126.9780, "accuracy": 5.0 },
    { "recordedAt": "2026-03-25T15:30:05", "lat": 37.5667, "lng": 126.9782, "accuracy": 4.5 },
    { "recordedAt": "2026-03-25T15:30:10", "lat": 37.5669, "lng": 126.9784, "accuracy": 5.0 },
    { "recordedAt": "2026-03-25T15:30:15", "lat": 37.5671, "lng": 126.9786, "accuracy": 4.0 }
  ]
}

###

### 산책 이력 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/walks?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 산책 상세 조회 (경로 GeoJSON 포함)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/walks/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
